            <ArticleTitle>Ectopic Parathyroid Incidentaloma on Tc99m SestaMIBI Myocardial Perfusion Imaging.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>235-236</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4103/ijnm.IJNM_5_17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Parathyroid incidentalomas are generally discovered during thyroid surgery.([1]) In the present case, the ectopic parathyroid adenoma was discovered as an incidentaloma in a clinical setting, during the course of clinical evaluation of atypical chest pain by gastroenterology and cardiology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
